-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">교사용 지도서 및 수업자료 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">사전 연수 포함</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"3\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l65534 level2 lfo65535;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">두산 사업장 견학 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">학기 중 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">회</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"3\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l65534 level2 lfo65535;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">두산 임직원 봉사자 파견 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">일부 차시</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"text-indent: 1pt; margin-top: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l65534 level1 lfo65535;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">모집대상 및 규모</span><br> <span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">서울</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">성남</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">수원</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">인천</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">익산</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">군산</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">창원 지